{"body":"# Generate Link Token

## In plain words

Ask for a [link token](/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#link-token) for one patient before you link their care contexts. The call returns 202 Accepted, and the token arrives on your bridge at [on-generate-token](/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/01-m2-post-v3-hip-token-on-generate-token). A link token is valid for six months, so store it and reuse it until it expires.

Send `abhaAddress`, `name`, `gender` and `yearOfBirth` as you hold them for the patient. Add `abhaNumber` when the patient has one linked to the address.

## Before you start

A gateway session token and your HIP id. Send the `REQUEST-ID`, `TIMESTAMP`, `X-CM-ID` and `X-HIP-ID` headers.

## What happens

`gender` takes `M`, `F`, `O`, `D`, `T` or `U`. `yearOfBirth` is four digits. If you send both `abhaNumber` and `abhaAddress` here, send both again on the link call.

## How you know it worked

A `linkToken` arrives on `/api/v3/hip/token/on-generate-token`, carrying your `REQUEST-ID` as `requestId`.

## When it goes wrong

`ABDM-1035` (Invalid HIP ID): check `X-HIP-ID`. `ABDM-2402` (Invalid Timestamp): check `TIMESTAMP` against your clock. `ABDM-2404` (Invalid Request Id): send a fresh UUID in `REQUEST-ID`. `ABDM-2500` (Authorization header is missing): send the session token. `ABDM-9999` (Unknown exception) gives no cause.","catalogue_version":"2026.09.16","doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-abdm-link-token-hip/01-m2-post-v3-token-generate-token#m2-generate-link-token","gateway":"hiecm","id":"hiecm.endpoint.m2-generate-link-token","milestone":"M2","operation":"m2_post_v3_token_generate_token","summary":"Ask for a link token for one patient; it arrives on your bridge and is valid for six months.","title":"Generate Link Token","type":"endpoint"}
{"catalogue_version":"2026.09.16","doc_path":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-post-v3-token-generate-token","operation_id":"m2_post_v3_token_generate_token","spec":{"description":"This API endpoint is used to generate a link token which will be valid for 6 months.. This token can be utilized for Health Information Provider (HIP) Initiated Linking, enabling HIPs to securely link patient health records to their ABHA (Ayushman Bharat Health Account) address. The generated token ensures that the linking process is authenticated and authorized, maintaining the integrity and security of health information exchange. This functionality is crucial for facilitating seamless and efficient linking of health records within the healthcare ecosystem.<ol type='a'><li><b>Authorization:</b> We are passing the access-token in the authorization [Example: Bearer  eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJBbFJiNVd]</li></ol>","operationId":"m2_post_v3_token_generate_token","parameters":[{"description":"Unique UUID for track the end to end request transaction","example":"18235d89-cb13-479d-ad71-7a57d5f669a8","in":"header","name":"REQUEST-ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"description":"Actual time of the request was initiated, ISO 8601 represents date and time by starting with the year, followed by the month, the day, the hour, the minutes, seconds and milliseconds","example":"2022-10-06T15:10:00.587Z","in":"header","name":"TIMESTAMP","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"description":"Suffix of the consent manager to which the request was intended","example":"sbx","in":"header","name":"X-CM-ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"description":"Identifier of the health information provider to which the request was intended","example":"IN2810014366","in":"header","name":"X-HIP-ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"description":"In the request body, either 'abhaNumber' or 'abhaAddress' must be included, with atleast one being mandatory based on the patient profile.","properties":{"abhaAddress":{"description":"abhaAddress of the user/patient. Allows alpha numeric character and special characters like ^[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9_.]+[a-zA-Z0-9]@(abdm|sbx)$","example":"<ABHA_ADDRESS>","nullable":true,"type":"string"},"abhaNumber":{"description":"it can be null if abhaNumber is not linked with abhaAddress. Allows numeric character like ^\d{14}$","example":12345678901234,"nullable":true,"type":"number"},"gender":{"description":"Allows M, F, O, D, T, U as a input","example":"M","type":"string"},"name":{"description":"Only alphabets and special characters like ',.- are allowed like ^[a-zA-Z]+(([',. -][a-zA-Z ])?[a-zA-Z]*)*$","example":"first_name + middle_name + last_name","type":"string"},"yearOfBirth":{"description":"Year of birth must be 4 digit, ranging between 1900 and 2200","example":9999,"type":"number"}},"required":["abhaAddress","name","gender","yearOfBirth"],"type":"object"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Accepted"},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"properties":{"error":{"description":"The error code and message, if any occurred.","properties":{"code":{"description":"ABDM-1035 - Invalid HIP ID. May be returned either bare (`ABDM-1035`) or with a trailing ": " separator (`ABDM-1035: `); match on the code itself and tolerate the separator.","example":"ABDM-1035","pattern":"^(ABDM-\d{4}|\d{3,6})(: )?$","type":"string"},"message":{"example":"Invalid HIP ID","type":"string"}},"required":["code","message"],"type":"object"}},"type":"object"}}},"description":"Bad Request"},"401":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"properties":{"code":{"description":"900902 - Unauthorized. May be returned either bare or with a trailing ": " separator; match on the code itself and tolerate the separator.","example":"900902","pattern":"^(ABDM-\d{4}|\d{3,6})(: )?$","type":"string"},"description":{"example":"Invalid Credentials.